<title>UK: Sterling Publishing Haines is exec chairman.</title>
<headline>Sterling Publishing Haines is exec chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling Publishing Group Plc said on Tuesday that Christopher Haines has been appointed as executive chairman of the company.</p>
<p>Simone Kesseler has joined the board as group chief executive, it said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Haines was the non executive chairman of the company.</p>
<p>It also said that Laurence Garman was joining the company as its group sales director.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
